                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "7dfe776b-314b-4572-b153-41f29dddc719",
                        "entry_id": "91a8b492-8d2e-3461-8226-ca9492bf48a6",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "irrévocables"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2cc52504-8ad1-3831-b2f6-53a281e04e89",
                        "entry_id": "91a8b492-8d2e-3461-8226-ca9492bf48a6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui ne peut être révoqué."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8ad7bb44-d969-45c6-8bf7-497eb2cef0e1",
                                "sense_id": "2cc52504-8ad1-3831-b2f6-53a281e04e89",
                                "text": "Au petit matin, juste à l’instant précis où il trempa délicatement son muffin tartiné de beurre de Nailsea dans son Earl Grey préféré, il prit la décision irrévocable de traverser l’Atlantique pour rejoindre le Pacifique."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ad50ee0-6331-47dc-b20c-dcc03a21b8eb",
                                "sense_id": "2cc52504-8ad1-3831-b2f6-53a281e04e89",
                                "text": "Beaux serments, jeunes résolutions irrévocables, et que le temps efface et anéantit bien vite, comme tout le reste !..."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c1a5d2c5-7b35-4866-9bba-5d6c714c9a9e",
                        "source_entry_id": "91a8b492-8d2e-3461-8226-ca9492bf48a6",
                        "source_sense_id": "2cc52504-8ad1-3831-b2f6-53a281e04e89",
                        "target_lang_word": "unwiderruflich",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unwiderruflich",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7bca4bb0-f2b0-397a-8c0b-4a9ba17e11fa",
                                        "entry_id": "c05b6e73-0207-3fed-acd3-f5946927af6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ohne Möglichkeit, etwas zu widerrufen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38edd6d7-5a2f-441a-9696-3b6b93e5dbb8",
                                                "sense_id": "7bca4bb0-f2b0-397a-8c0b-4a9ba17e11fa",
                                                "text": "Das Urteil steht unwiderruflich fest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74bfb978-2487-4572-a328-ecbac6036000",
                                                "sense_id": "7bca4bb0-f2b0-397a-8c0b-4a9ba17e11fa",
                                                "text": "„Aber sie gehören inzwischen unwiderruflich zum Fachvokabular der Soziologie […], ohne daß als Grund dafür mehr als Gewöhnung an einen Zufall bei der Wahl eines geeigneten Wortes für eine noch nicht begriffene Sache ersichtlich ist – eines Wortes, das in einem großen, prädisziplinär-terminologischen Fundus zusammen mit anderen potentiellen Fachtermini zu fast beliebiger Verwendung bereit lag.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "32aa8840-123d-3e9e-ae81-1f7e8c520f8c",
                                        "entry_id": "c05b6e73-0207-3fed-acd3-f5946927af6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "nicht rückgängig zu machen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3fc4a4e-bf5b-488c-a0d7-0939c3faac94",
                                                "sense_id": "32aa8840-123d-3e9e-ae81-1f7e8c520f8c",
                                                "text": "Mit diesem Programm werden die Daten von der Festplatte unwiderruflich gelöscht."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "de315787-790f-44ef-8f27-93ae965be910",
                        "source_entry_id": "91a8b492-8d2e-3461-8226-ca9492bf48a6",
                        "source_sense_id": "2cc52504-8ad1-3831-b2f6-53a281e04e89",
                        "target_lang_word": "irrevocable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "irrevocable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8d45989c-ce55-3412-b70c-caa0738d75aa",
                                        "entry_id": "e123cafe-c870-3ce6-af8e-57f0defa93d3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unable to be retracted or reversed; final."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb8c9278-d9cb-4259-b326-425ef9508074",
                                                "sense_id": "8d45989c-ce55-3412-b70c-caa0738d75aa",
                                                "text": "Firm and irrevocable is my doom\nWhich I have pass'd upon her; she is banish'd."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0c84269-9148-4b17-a1fe-2ee098f96492",
                                                "sense_id": "8d45989c-ce55-3412-b70c-caa0738d75aa",
                                                "text": "I have talked thus to you, child, not to insult you for what is past and irrevocable, but to caution and strengthen you for the future."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "697ecb25-5d97-470a-a3b4-09f396e23b87",
                                                "sense_id": "8d45989c-ce55-3412-b70c-caa0738d75aa",
                                                "text": "On each face, wonder and fear were painted vividly; each so still and silent, looking at the other over the black gulf of the irrevocable past."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fae27ea-e5c6-40a3-9979-b955dc0d1c34",
                                                "sense_id": "8d45989c-ce55-3412-b70c-caa0738d75aa",
                                                "text": "Once again, Mario Cipollini has announced his definite, absolute, unswerving and irrevocable decision to retire, and this time he means it. Probably."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bcd33a66-a99f-49ba-85a6-0f276cd8b242",
                        "source_entry_id": "91a8b492-8d2e-3461-8226-ca9492bf48a6",
                        "source_sense_id": "2cc52504-8ad1-3831-b2f6-53a281e04e89",
